cmu-sling-switch-rail = Configure for rail mounting
cmu-sling-switch-underbarrel = Configure for underbarrel mounting
cmu-sling-set-rail = The sling is now configured for rail mounting.
cmu-sling-set-underbarrel = The sling is now configured for underbarrel mounting.
cmu-sling-detach-first = Detach the sling before changing its mounting position.
cmu-sling-examine-rail = Configured for rail mounting. Alt-click to switch to underbarrel mounting.
cmu-sling-examine-underbarrel = Configured for underbarrel mounting. Alt-click to switch to the dedicated sling mounting point. Locked built-in attachments cannot be replaced.
cmu-aslot-sling = Sling
cmu-sling-switch-sling = Configure for sling mounting point
cmu-sling-set-sling = The sling is now configured for its dedicated mounting point.
cmu-sling-examine-sling = Configured for the dedicated sling mounting point. Alt-click to switch to rail mounting.
cmu-sling-switch-carry-vest = Configure the sling to attach the rifle to your vest
cmu-sling-switch-carry-suitstorage = Configure the sling to use suit storage
cmu-sling-set-carry-vest = The sling will now attach the rifle to your vest.
cmu-sling-set-carry-suitstorage = The sling will now use suit storage.
cmu-sling-examine-carry-vest = Configured to attach the rifle to your vest. Alt-click to switch to suit storage.
cmu-sling-examine-carry-suitstorage = Configured to use suit storage. Alt-click to switch to attaching the rifle to your vest.
cmu-sling-vest-occupied = There is already a rifle attached to this vest.
